{"title":"2015 AIME I Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/4/29486ec44bf1cfe3c8029a18874a9160430a5980.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A,B,C,D,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"85\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> are equally spaced on a minor arc of a circle. Points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/7/3975efe2f69a9c2b6452f653c33daa025c350093.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E,F,G,H,I$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> are equally spaced on a minor arc of a second circle with center <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> as shown in the figure below. The angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/3/f93e72b9d2c86f197276a931aba77c472d0511c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABD$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> exceeds <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/9/ea99ef5dc56b7f60916e2357dfc4340a39aff68b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AHG$\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/d/2bd610280bd19f29ea0e5bf0cca5ec870c461b98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" />. Find the degree measure of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/6/6f6632e03af21cbf15779ef0ecf1a5f36a67cf00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAG$\" width=\"55\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/9/5590bc90f068d76cce0399a7cf16b9bcf4f72c94.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A,B,C,D,E,F,G,H,I,O; O=(0,0); C=dir(90); B=dir(70); A=dir(50); D=dir(110); E=dir(130); draw(arc(O,1,50,130)); real x=2*sin(20*pi/180); F=x*dir(228)+C; G=x*dir(256)+C; H=x*dir(284)+C; I=x*dir(312)+C; draw(arc(C,x,200,340)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,dir(0)); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,dir(75)); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,dir(90)); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,dir(105)); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,E,dir(180)); label(&quot;$F$&quot;,F,dir(225)); label(&quot;$G$&quot;,G,dir(260)); label(&quot;$H$&quot;,H,dir(280)); label(&quot;$I$&quot;,I,dir(315)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"152\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> be the center of the circle with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/3/f13a96240c51d61ba3733d9f5c3020fa92ec4136.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCDE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" /> on it. \n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the degree measurement of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/4/5347be249e826b4d7ba3eb2a89a438ce1d59a2e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overarc{ED}=\\overarc{DC}=\\overarc{CB}=\\overarc{BA}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"169\" height=\"21\" /> in circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> \n</p><p>and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be the degree measurement of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/d/35d4a1960168aab25764e0f5c5bdfb7d29605474.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overarc{EF}=\\overarc{FG}=\\overarc{GH}=\\overarc{HI}=\\overarc{IA}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"204\" height=\"21\" /> in circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/0/6402ee5ae3d86eb7ccb4a7ecc335715785362929.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ECA$\" width=\"55\" height=\"13\" /> is, therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/c/44c50540796f3f50358166de93fd66419e585e48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"18\" height=\"16\" /> by way of circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/4/7346c2d0d52d93d38200b244afc1625b74251c88.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{360-4x}{2}=180-2x\\]\" width=\"163\" height=\"37\" /> by way of circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/3/f93e72b9d2c86f197276a931aba77c472d0511c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABD$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/c/54c7efa0c0df94c8ee1bddf0daa072bdd935cca5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180 - \\frac{3x}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"71\" height=\"37\" /> by way of circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/2/842becc4fa07fdf2ba124ab05786581188ed2814.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle AHG = 180 - \\frac{3y}{2}\\]\" width=\"151\" height=\"37\" /> by way of circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>This means that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/a/6ba464c1383786f08b6671e26c97ad04450be857.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[180-\\frac{3x}{2}=180-\\frac{3y}{2}+12\\]\" width=\"207\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>which when simplified yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/7/6570f5e59445d076f88363c17c72185d20720677.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{3x}{2}+12=\\frac{3y}{2}\\]\" width=\"107\" height=\"37\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/5/375c28b03b662d714983f63f518ed9179e4f4e09.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+8=y\\]\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />\nSince:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/b/8cbf5df0cca32ea117ce7824fa4c751b5cd965e0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle ACE=5y=180-2x\\]\" width=\"190\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/6/cc69e4f4395986316f7db7e90f7216c5d716d323.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5x+40=180-2x\\]\" width=\"152\" height=\"14\" />\nSo:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5e20c39ed1930990a15672fb2d4ad0c0bcc7a00.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[7x=140\\Longleftrightarrow x=20\\]\" width=\"165\" height=\"13\" /> \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/a/52a0066bb145e63fdb549efbe2cf6616041620be.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y=28\\]\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/6/6f6632e03af21cbf15779ef0ecf1a5f36a67cf00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAG$\" width=\"55\" height=\"13\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/7/9a7c91a101ced918d8e65b28d228a274aad9df9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAE$\" width=\"55\" height=\"13\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/2/63213b21a451dced31ed2764671160817bee14ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle EAG$\" width=\"55\" height=\"13\" />, which equates to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/7/0a781ed06d32a3e53bb422a82328126f2429491d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3x}{2} + y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" />.\nPlugging in yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/5/eb5ecae605dce6fcbd635d44e64c638a9d19f52d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30+28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/5/595820fe458ff997793671c7d1d7de28890875bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{058}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> be the degree measurement of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/4/cc40781f36dfd0dae096b156b7174370eb122f24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle GCH$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/6/d76f11a95eee087fc68b7242b9b7b670aedc0e8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G,H$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"39\" height=\"16\" /> lie on a circle with center <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/3/4f3485377b96d3b9a8ade51bc33e4d1f47db1558.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle GHC=\\frac{180-m}{2}=90-\\frac{m}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"238\" height=\"38\" />. \n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/8/2d8ee6ab028049aaf27efd2a67c64ab587837db6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ACH=2 \\angle GCH=2m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"200\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/3/eb35bea7acca924490eeea8104aa87975353c839.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AHC=\\frac{180-2m}{2}=90-m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"243\" height=\"38\" />. Adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbe0048a1f760e0a03c8d7bbdb0fb4e05bf03db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle GHC$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/8/3f896e231ca1907e2bca0cd9fcfaeba7f9890dbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AHC$\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/8/ad80c0b94e2fb1f84c465128c10dc556a09e51bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AHG=180-\\frac{3m}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"162\" height=\"38\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/9/8b9005373838c71af2a12e8479d1a8190734e7e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABD=\\angle AHG+12=192-\\frac{3m}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"283\" height=\"38\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a65c05bd85d2609bea5db2b109ed5f556463511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> is parallel to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/8/238b05258a8f97ded8ef14ba4fd20fefdff83f53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DBA=180-\\angle ABD=\\frac{3m}{2}-12=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"302\" height=\"38\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/1255de59351139952259630dc538430bf97ff8a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overarc{BE}$\" width=\"23\" height=\"19\" />. \n</p><p>We are given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/8/9580b15ecb95e817f4cc6603baaa03ed71254759.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A,B,C,D,E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"103\" height=\"16\" /> are evenly distributed on a circle. Hence, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/4/5347be249e826b4d7ba3eb2a89a438ce1d59a2e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overarc{ED}=\\overarc{DC}=\\overarc{CB}=\\overarc{BA}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"169\" height=\"21\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/8/3a877ccd304c62eb377706aac19dca8cf9b5b678.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{\\angle DBA}{3}=\\frac{m}{2}-4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"157\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Here comes the key: Draw a line through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> parallel to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a65c05bd85d2609bea5db2b109ed5f556463511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" />, and select a point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> to the right of point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/4/aa42dc70d2a6cc8b53622c2195da64b7f65f4e33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ACX$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/1/46180eb959c629334a434c2dbf88768e4d104c34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overarc{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"23\" height=\"20\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/9/f997f2e439fbb9578ac4d715bc866bbea93ebc2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overarc{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"23\" height=\"20\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/8/1889ef6ad8dc9e54735ca23c51b89f228af5633b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m-8$\" width=\"46\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Let the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/9/c49d6bc43e130fec439edb96e4e1d8ad8037941e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{HG}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/6/046cd518e19f2ef1b35212b7a6cac924e61437e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle YCX=\\angle ACX+\\angle ACY=(m-8)+\\frac{5m}{2}=90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"398\" height=\"38\" />. Solving gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/1/d517eb07b2aaa054845faf9d389e84b07d6e0ad6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=28$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>The rest of the solution proceeds as in solution 1, which gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/5/595820fe458ff997793671c7d1d7de28890875bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{058}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2015_AIME_I_6.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/a/a5/2015_AIME_I_6.png/500px-2015_AIME_I_6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"215\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/a/a5/2015_AIME_I_6.png/750px-2015_AIME_I_6.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/a/a5/2015_AIME_I_6.png/1000px-2015_AIME_I_6.png 2x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/1/861d925475149f00abd74b3aa394813b24ff9a32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle GAH = \\varphi \\implies \\overset{\\Large\\frown} {GH} = 2\\varphi \\implies$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"265\" height=\"27\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/c/3dc9299101cc52f161b2bedc3dc6fdf160c19920.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\overset{\\Large\\frown} {EF} = \\overset{\\Large\\frown} {FG} = \\overset{\\Large\\frown} {HI} = \\overset{\\Large\\frown} {IA} = 2\\varphi \\implies\\]\" width=\"262\" height=\"24\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/a/f5a8d3eef000eb70684764a0e654aa5117f9a1ef.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle AGH = 2\\varphi, \\angle ACE = 10 \\varphi.\\]\" width=\"223\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/6/cd69c78739ad379d14dd41d365ccc224876d453b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[BD||GH \\implies \\angle AJB = \\angle AGH = 2 \\varphi.\\]\" width=\"303\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/2/7b22e9057191459252f00821e109c988c79b3e8b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\triangle AHG: \\hspace{10mm}  \\angle AHG = \\beta = 180^\\circ – 3 \\varphi.\\]\" width=\"307\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/7/ce777b06e002797460c1705d959964253a9d4acb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\hspace{10mm} \\triangle ABJ:  \\hspace{10mm} \\angle BAG + \\angle ABD = \\alpha + \\gamma = 180^\\circ + 2 \\varphi.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"478\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Let arc <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/2/e72b4c1715abd38f38937228ca7823a805cdd61d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overset{\\Large\\frown} {AB} = 2\\psi \\implies$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"120\" height=\"27\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/c/dac82090f33d69ac40b82624378f975031a84578.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ACE = \\frac {360^\\circ – 8 \\psi}{2}= 180^\\circ – 4 \\psi,  \\angle ABD = \\gamma =\\frac {360^\\circ – 6 \\psi}{2} =180^\\circ – 3 \\psi.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"529\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/0/940432f4bf7399e3861c17264bdd265bebf86481.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gamma –  \\beta = 3(\\varphi – \\psi) = 12^\\circ \\implies \\psi = \\varphi – 4^\\circ \\implies 10 \\varphi = 180^\\circ – 4(\\varphi – 4^\\circ) \\implies 14 \\varphi = 196^\\circ \\implies \\varphi = 14^\\circ.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"753\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/3/30347048c58475eba15c6ec980d9dcb0cfca36a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gamma = 180^\\circ – 3 \\cdot (14^\\circ – 4^\\circ) = 150^\\circ \\implies  \\alpha = 180^\\circ + 2 \\cdot 14^\\circ – 150^\\circ = \\boxed{\\textbf{058}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"531\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/IuwkX2Dv25s\">https://youtu.be/IuwkX2Dv25s</a>\n</p><p>~MathProblemSolvingSkills.com\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AIME_I\" title=\"2015 AIME I\">2015 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2015 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2015\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2015 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 AIME I Problems/Problem 